d by Hans Scharoun."],["Gemäldegalerie","sight",52.50861,13.36472,"Matthäikirchplatz (Stauffenbergstraße 40)","Tue Wed Fri 10:00–18:00, Thu 10:00–20:00, Sat Sun 11:00–18:00","","","","r","The Gemäldegalerie contains an astounding array of paintings, including works by Rembrandt, Rubens, Botticelli, Raphael, Titian, Goya, Velasquez and Watteau. The collection contains works from the old Bodemuseum on Museumsinsel in the…"],["Kupferstichkabinettt","sight",52.5084,13.367,"Matthäikirchplatz","Tue–Fri 10:00–18:00, Sat Sun 11:00–18:00","","","","r","The largest collection of graphic art in Germany."],["Theater am Potsdamer Platz","activity",52.50726,13.37218,"Marlene-Dietrich-Platz 1","","","","","r","Musicaltheater and Berlinale (Berlin International Film Festival)."],["Berliner Philharmonie","activity",52.50999,13.36964,"Herbert-von-Karajan-Str. 1","","","","","r","The Berliner Philharmonie is a concert hall with 2,440 seats in Berlin-Tiergarten (constructed from 1960 to 1963 and designed by Hans Scharoun) and the home of the Berlin Philharmonic Orchestra. It is a famous building with outstanding…"],["CineStar IMAX im Sony Center","activity",52.51004,13.37278,"Potsdamer Straße 4","","","","","r","The worldwide recognised theatre at Potsdamer Straße"],["CineStar Original","activity",52.5096,13.37349,"","","","","","r","The \"CineStar Original\" cinema located inside the Sony Center at the Potsdamer-Platz shows only movies in original version (e.g. in English, without subtitles)."],["Club Olympus Spa & Fitness","activity",52.50855,13.37227,"Marlene-Dietrich-Platz 2","","","","","r","At the Grand Hyatt Berlin Hotel."],["BlueMax Theater","activity",52.50695,13.37337,"Marlene-Dietrich-Platz 4","","","","","r","Home of the Blue Man Group. Used to house an IMAX cinema."],["Großer Tiergarten","activity",52.51667,13.36667,"","","","","","r","Berlin's largest park. In the summer and on weekends you will see loads of families with their barbecues."],["Brasserie Desbrosses","restau